---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Custom AI Solutions for Small Businesses | Span AI Solutions"
  description="Start with a free systems audit. We find your highest-impact AI opportunities, then build, test and maintain the solution for you."
>
  <main>
    <section class="hero page-shell" aria-labelledby="custom-title">
      <p class="eyebrow">Custom AI Solutions</p>
      <h1 class="hero-title" id="custom-title">AI built around how your business actually runs.</h1>
      <p class="lead">We find the parts of your business where AI can save the most time and money, then build, test and maintain the solution for you.</p>
      <div class="actions">
        <a class="button button--primary" href="/contact?service=custom">Book a free systems audit</a>
        <a class="button button--ghost" href="#process">See how it works</a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section page-shell" aria-label="Client testimonial">
      <blockquote class="quote">
        <p>“From day one, he brought a clear sense of direction, keeping everything on track… If you're looking for someone who can lead projects with both precision and empathy, Josh is the person you want on your team!”</p>
        <footer>— Yeshua Can Yıldırım, Partner &amp; COO, Puente Global</footer>
      </blockquote>
    </section>

    <section class="section page-shell" aria-labelledby="custom-problem">
      <h2 class="section-heading" id="custom-problem">You know AI could help. You're just not sure where to start.</h2>
      <ul class="cards">
        <li class="card">Your team loses hours every week to repetitive tasks.</li>
        <li class="card">You've tried AI tools, but they don't fit how you actually work.</li>
        <li class="card">You don't have the time or the technical team to figure it out yourself.</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="section-copy">If it slows your business down, we can probably build something for it. That's the gap we bridge.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="section page-shell" id="process" aria-labelledby="custom-process">
      <h2 class="section-heading" id="custom-process">Our AI solutions are systems that actually work.</h2>
      <ol class="cards">
        <li class="card"><h3>Systems audit</h3><p>We map how your business runs today and where AI can realistically help.</p><p class="eyebrow">Free</p></li>
        <li class="card"><h3>Pick the highest-impact wins</h3><p>We identify the 1–3 systems that will save you the most time or money first.</p><p>No big-bang projects. You see value early.</p></li>
        <li class="card"><h3>Build and connect</h3><p>We set up AI agents inside the tools you already use.</p></li>
        <li class="card"><h3>Test until it's reliable</h3><p>Every workflow is tested on real scenarios before it goes live.</p></li>
        <li class="card"><h3>Ongoing maintenance</h3><p>We monitor and improve everything so it keeps working as your business grows.</p></li>
      </ol>
    </section>

    <section class="section page-shell" aria-labelledby="custom-pricing">
      <h2 class="section-heading" id="custom-pricing">Priced around your business, not a package</h2>
      <p class="section-copy">Every business is different, so every solution is quoted individually. It starts with a free systems audit call. Afterwards, we'll send you a clear proposal with scope, timeline and cost. No pressure, no surprises.</p>
      <a class="button button--primary" href="/contact?service=custom">Book a free systems audit</a>
    </section>

    <section class="section page-shell faq" aria-labelledby="custom-faq">
      <h2 class="section-heading" id="custom-faq">FAQ</h2>
      <details><summary>Do I need a technical team?</summary><p>No. We handle the setup, testing and maintenance. You just tell us how your business works.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Will it work with the tools I already use?</summary><p>In most cases, yes. We build around your existing tools wherever possible.</p></details>
      <details><summary>How long does it take?</summary><p>It depends on scope, but we focus on delivering your first win quickly.</p></details>
      <details><summary>What if something breaks?</summary><p>We monitor your workflows and fix issues as part of ongoing maintenance.</p></details>
      <details><summary>What does it cost?</summary><p>The systems audit call is free. After that, every project is quoted individually based on what you need.</p></details>
    </section>

    <section class="section page-shell" aria-labelledby="custom-cta">
      <div class="cta-panel">
        <h2 class="section-heading" id="custom-cta">Let's find your first win.</h2>
        <p class="section-copy">Book a free systems audit and we'll show you where AI can help your business most.</p>
        <a class="button button--primary" href="/contact?service=custom">Book a free systems audit</a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
